{"id":"steam-5053190","steam":5053190,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Warpscape","summary":"An open-world space MMORPG with no-target combat. You fly the ship and aim yourself, travel between sectors, take on bosses and dungeons with friends, fight in the arena and build your clan's base.","about":"Warpscape is an open-world space MMORPG. The world is split into sectors, and each one is made for a certain pilot level. A sector has stations, asteroid fields, pirates and other players flying around you. When you outgrow your sector, you fly through the gate to the next one. New sectors open as you level up and are added with updates.\n\nCOMBAT WITHOUT AUTO-AIM\n\nYou don't lock onto a target and wait for the ship to fire on its own. You fly with the keyboard and aim with the mouse. Enemies move, so you have to lead your shots, and you can dodge theirs.\n\nBOSSES AND DUNGEONS\n\nThe sectors have bosses you can attack. Most of them are stronger than one pilot, so players usually go in as a group. Besides open space there are dungeons: separate locations with their own enemies, puzzles and a boss at the end.\n\nPVP\n\nIf you want to fight people, there is a ranked arena in 1v1, 2v2 and 3v3, and you can duel any pilot. If you don't, switch your pilot to PvE mode and other players can't attack you. Every station has a free zone where nobody can shoot.\n\nSHIPS\n\nShips come as scouts, fighters and bombers, and new ones unlock as you level. You switch ships at a shipyard, and each ship keeps its own modules, cargo hold and paint, so you can keep several ships for different jobs.\n\nSKINS\n\nEvery ship has its own skins, from common to legendary. They drop from cases and are sold in the shop, and you can change your skin at any time.\n\nCLANS\n\nPlayers band together in clans. A clan gets a base aboard a large carrier ship, with a shared vault, turrets and its own fleet that members buy and upgrade together.\n\nECONOMY\n\nMine ore from asteroids, refine it, then craft and enhance your gear. Sell on the market or trade directly with another player.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/9f6d07625a750d1d7ca7b1eabe4402c2ab1b50dc/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794508035","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/f514645e2361c638609dc5e410f36579cc9faccd/header.jpg?t=1794508035","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/66c24a259b976cf7ee16da6930f5e4705925a87a/library_hero.jpg?t=1794508035","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/f514645e2361c638609dc5e410f36579cc9faccd/header.jpg?t=1794508035","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/a1e4c31b6c2f47512cd22a3d30bcc5d6f7e230f0/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1794508035","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/ad443f4674182e03e9aad748727f343127374613/ss_ad443f4674182e03e9aad748727f343127374613.600x338.jpg?t=1794508035","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/ad443f4674182e03e9aad748727f343127374613/ss_ad443f4674182e03e9aad748727f343127374613.jpg?t=1794508035"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/6982b1c932b91dd44ed887bb5ae0d5859795d0dc/ss_6982b1c932b91dd44ed887bb5ae0d5859795d0dc.600x338.jpg?t=1794508035","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/6982b1c932b91dd44ed887bb5ae0d5859795d0dc/ss_6982b1c932b91dd44ed887bb5ae0d5859795d0dc.jpg?t=1794508035"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/c775305129052a588e7ba222bad06a90320bd1ae/ss_c775305129052a588e7ba222bad06a90320bd1ae.600x338.jpg?t=1794508035","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5053190/c775305129052a588e7ba222bad06a90320bd1ae/ss_c775305129052a588e7ba222bad06a903